  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Liu Chang escapes Hei Lou Lan’s attack range. Hei Lou Lan gives chase. Liu Chang stops and tells her she has fallen into his trap. Intense light explodes and envelops the whole battlefield. The Gu Immortal spectators close their eyes at once. Hei Lou Lan shuts her eyes, then opens them to a scene that is still completely white. Her vision is white and she cannot see.",
      "chapters": [
        2188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_liu_chang",
        "char_hei_lou_lan",
        "sys_gu_immortal"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Onlookers say Liu Chang actually learned this killer move. They call it Liu tribe’s trump card method, and say that once a Gu cultivator is hit, recovery is extremely difficult unless they use Liu tribe’s special recovery method.",
      "chapters": [
        2188
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_liu_tribe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Liu Chang scoffs that she has already lost and cannot counter his Liu tribe’s bedazzlement killer move in this battle, and that stalling for time is useless. Yin Wu Que then asks that the move on Fairy Black Moon be dispelled according to the agreement. A Liu tribe elder uses a killer move and restores her vision.",
